On the **fixed source-typed A3 q2-beta section** with center `(C,V,U)`, `q_beta = t + beta t^2 + t^{25}`, and live compiler derivative `q_beta' = 1 + 2 beta t + 25 t^{24}`, after transport to 132 free variables:

